// Zephira fallback combat script. The main combat logic mirrors the
// Dark Horizons CMTRISD script; this separate override gives the area
// script a deterministic second path into combat after Dimwoork's dialogue.
IF
  Global("DH9_TRIST_FIGHT","GLOBAL",1)
  !Allegiance(Myself,ENEMY)
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    Enemy()
    AttackReevaluate(Player1,30)
END
